<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://accounts.google.com; connect-src 'self' https://www.googleapis.com https://oauth2.googleapis.com https://accounts.google.com; frame-src https://accounts.google.com https://drive.google.com https://docs.google.com; img-src 'self' data: https:; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src https://fonts.gstatic.com;">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="black-translucent">
<title>Biblioteca — Tu Librería Personal</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;0,700;1,400&family=Lora:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;1,400&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<script src="https://accounts.google.com/gsi/client" async defer></script>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #1a1410;
    --bg2: #231e18;
    --bg3: #2e2720;
    --surface: #332c24;
    --surface2: #3d342a;
    --accent: #c9a96e;
    --accent2: #e8c98a;
    --accent-dim: rgba(201,169,110,0.15);
    --text: #f0e8d8;
    --text2: #b8a88a;
    --text3: #7a6a52;
    --red: #d4634a;
    --green: #5a9e6f;
    --green-dim: rgba(90,158,111,0.15);
    --border: rgba(201,169,110,0.12);
    --border2: rgba(201,169,110,0.25);
    --shadow: 0 8px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
    --reading-bg: #faf6ef;
    --reading-text: #2c2416;
    --reading-text2: #6b5a3e;
    --font-display: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    --font-body: 'Lora', serif;
    --font-ui: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    --r: 12px;
    --r-sm: 6px;
    --transition: 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1);
    --sidebar-w: 260px;
    --topbar-h: 60px;
    --mobile-nav-h: 64px;
  }
  .light-mode {
    --bg: #f5f0e8;
    --bg2: #ede8dc;
    --bg3: #e4ddd0;
    --surface: #ffffff;
    --surface2: #f9f5ef;
    --accent: #8b6914;
    --accent2: #a37c1e;
    --accent-dim: rgba(139,105,20,0.08);
    --text: #1e1a13;
    --text2: #5c4f38;
    --text3: #9a8a6e;
    --border: rgba(139,105,20,0.12);
    --border2: rgba(139,105,20,0.25);
    --shadow: 0 8px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
    --green-dim: rgba(60,120,80,0.1);
  }
  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; }
  html, body { height: 100%; font-family: var(--font-ui); background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); transition: background var(--transition), color var(--transition); overflow: hidden; }

  /* ── LAYOUT ── */
  #app { display: grid; grid-template-columns: var(--sidebar-w) 1fr; grid-template-rows: var(--topbar-h) 1fr; height: 100vh; height: 100dvh; }
  #app.has-reconnect-banner { grid-template-rows: auto var(--topbar-h) 1fr; }

  /* ── TOPBAR ── */
  #topbar {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    background: var(--bg2);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 0 24px; gap: 16px;
    position: relative; z-index: 20;
  }
  .logo { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 22px; color: var(--accent); letter-spacing: 0.02em; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .logo span { font-style: italic; }
  .menu-toggle { display: none; width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 50%; border: 1px solid var(--border2); background: transparent; color: var(--text2); cursor: pointer; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; transition: all var(--transition); }
  .menu-toggle:hover { background: var(--accent-dim); color: var(--accent); }
  .menu-toggle svg { width: 18px; height: 18px; }
  .topbar-search { flex: 1; max-width: 400px; position: relative; margin-left: 24px; }
  .topbar-search input {
    width: 100%; padding: 8px 16px 8px 40px;
    background: var(--bg3); border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 50px; color: var(--text); font-family: var(--font-ui); font-size: 14px;
    outline: none; transition: border var(--transition);
  }
  .topbar-search input:focus { border-color: var(--accent); }
  .topbar-search input::placeholder { color: var(--text3); }
  .topbar-search svg { position: absolute; left: 13px; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); color: var(--text3); width: 16px; height: 16px; }
  .topbar-actions { margin-left: auto; display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; }
  .btn-icon {
    width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 50%; border: 1px solid var(--border2);
    background: transparent; color: var(--text2); cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    transition: all var(--transition); flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .btn-icon:hover { background: var(--accent-dim); color: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); }
  .btn-icon svg { width: 18px; height: 18px; }
  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--accent); color: var(--bg); border: none; border-radius: 50px;
    padding: 8px 18px; font-family: var(--font-ui); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500;
    cursor: pointer; transition: all var(--transition); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--accent2); transform: translateY(-1px); }
  .btn-primary:active { transform: translateY(0); }

  /* ── SIDEBAR ── */
  #sidebar {
    background: var(--bg2); border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden;
    transition: transform var(--transition);
  }
  .sidebar-section { padding: 20px 16px 8px; }
  .sidebar-label { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text3); margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .nav-item {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 9px 12px; border-radius: var(--r-sm);
    color: var(--text2); font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer; transition: all var(--transition); margin-bottom: 2px;
    user-select: none;
  }
  .nav-item:hover { background: var(--accent-dim); color: var(--text); }
  .nav-item:active { background: var(--accent-dim); }
  .nav-item.active { background: var(--accent-dim); color: var(--accent); font-weight: 500; }
  .nav-item svg { width: 18px; height: 18px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .nav-badge { margin-left: auto; background: var(--accent); color: var(--bg); border-radius: 50px; font-size: 11px; padding: 1px 7px; font-weight: 500; }
  .sidebar-genres { padding: 0 16px 16px; overflow-y: auto; flex: 1; }
  .genre-tag {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 50px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border); color: var(--text2); font-size: 12px; cursor: pointer;
    margin: 3px; transition: all var(--transition); user-select: none;
  }
  .genre-tag:hover, .genre-tag.active { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); background: var(--accent-dim); }

  /* ── SIDEBAR DATA ACTIONS ── */
  .sidebar-data-section {
    padding: 12px 16px 16px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;
  }
  .btn-data {
    width: 100%; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
    padding: 9px 12px; border-radius: var(--r-sm);
    border: 1px solid var(--border2); background: transparent;
    color: var(--text2); font-family: var(--font-ui); font-size: 13px; cursor: pointer;
    transition: all var(--transition); text-align: left;
  }
  .btn-data:hover { background: var(--accent-dim); color: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); }
  .btn-data svg { width: 15px; height: 15px; flex-shrink: 0; }

  /* ── MAIN ── */
  #main { overflow-y: auto; background: var(--bg); }

  /* ── LIBRARY VIEW ── */
  #library-view { padding: 32px; }
  .section-header { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .section-title { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 24px; color: var(--text); }
  .section-sub { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text3); }
  .books-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(160px, 1fr)); gap: 24px; }
  .book-card { cursor: pointer; transition: transform var(--transition); position: relative; }
  .book-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); }
  .book-card:hover .book-cover-wrap { box-shadow: 0 16px 48px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); }
  .book-cover-wrap {
    position: relative; border-radius: var(--r-sm); overflow: hidden;
    aspect-ratio: 2/3; box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    transition: box-shadow var(--transition);
  }
  .book-cover {
    width: 100%; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 16px; text-align: center;
    position: relative; overflow: hidden;
  }
  /* Photo cover */
  .book-cover.has-photo {
    padding: 0;
    background-size: cover !important;
    background-position: center !important;
    background-repeat: no-repeat !important;
  }
  .book-cover.has-photo .book-cover-overlay {
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0,0,0,0.85) 35%, rgba(0,0,0,0.1) 70%, transparent 100%);
  }
  .book-cover.has-photo .book-cover-spine,
  .book-cover.has-photo .book-cover-icon { display: none; }
  .book-cover.has-photo .book-cover-title,
  .book-cover.has-photo .book-cover-author {
    position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 2;
  }
  .book-cover.has-photo .book-cover-title { bottom: 28px; font-size: 13px; padding: 0 10px; }
  .book-cover.has-photo .book-cover-author { bottom: 12px; font-size: 10px; padding: 0 10px; }
  .book-cover.has-photo .book-progress-bar { z-index: 3; }

  /* Fallback (no photo) */
  .book-cover::before {
    content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 0%, transparent 50%, rgba(0,0,0,0.2) 100%);
  }
  .book-cover.has-photo::before { display: none; }
  .book-cover-spine { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; bottom: 0; width: 6px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3); }
  .book-cover-title { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; text-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); position: relative; z-index: 1; line-height: 1.3; }
  .book-cover-author { font-size: 10px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75); margin-top: 8px; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .book-cover-icon { font-size: 32px; margin-bottom: 10px; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .book-progress-bar { position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 3px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.4); }
  .book-progress-fill { height: 100%; background: var(--accent); transition: width 0.5s ease; }
  .book-lang-badge {
    position: absolute; top: 8px; right: 8px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
    color: #fff; font-size: 9px; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 50px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }
  /* Times read badge on card */
  .book-times-badge {
    position: absolute; top: 8px; left: 8px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.65);
    color: var(--accent2); font-size: 9px; padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 50px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 3px;
  }
  .book-info { margin-top: 10px; }
  .book-title { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text); line-height: 1.3; margin-bottom: 2px; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
  .book-author { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text3); }
  .book-actions { display: flex; gap: 6px; margin-top: 8px; }
  .btn-sm {
    flex: 1; padding: 6px 0; border-radius: var(--r-sm); border: 1px solid var(--border2);
    background: transparent; color: var(--text2); font-size: 11px; cursor: pointer; transition: all var(--transition); font-family: var(--font-ui);
  }
  .btn-sm:hover { background: var(--accent-dim); color: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); }
  .btn-sm.danger:hover { background: rgba(212,99,74,0.15); color: var(--red); border-color: var(--red); }
  .empty-state { text-align: center; padding: 80px 40px; color: var(--text3); }
  .empty-state svg { width: 64px; height: 64px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--text3); opacity: 0.4; }
  .empty-state h3 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 20px; color: var(--text2); margin-bottom: 8px; }

  /* ── READER VIEW ── */
  #reader-view {
    display: none; position: fixed; inset: var(--topbar-h) 0 0 var(--sidebar-w);
    background: var(--reading-bg); color: var(--reading-text); z-index: 10;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  #reader-view.open { display: flex; }
  .reader-topbar {
    display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 0 24px; height: 52px; gap: 12px;
    background: rgba(250,246,239,0.95); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 5; backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .reader-title { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 16px; font-style: italic; flex: 1; color: var(--reading-text); white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
  .reader-controls { display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .reader-btn {
    padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 50px; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
    background: transparent; color: var(--reading-text2); font-size: 12px; cursor: pointer; transition: all var(--transition);
    font-family: var(--font-ui); white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .reader-btn:hover { background: rgba(0,0,0,0.06); }
  .reader-btn.accent { background: var(--accent); color: var(--bg); border-color: transparent; }
  .reader-btn.accent:hover { background: var(--accent2); }
  .reader-content { flex: 1; overflow-y: auto; display: flex; justify-content: center; padding: 48px 24px 80px; }
  .reader-paper {
    max-width: 640px; width: 100%;
    font-family: var(--font-body); line-height: 1.9; color: var(--reading-text);
  }
  .reader-chapter-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 28px; color: var(--reading-text);
    margin-bottom: 32px; padding-bottom: 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
  }
  .reader-paper p { margin-bottom: 1.4em; font-size: 18px; text-align: justify; hyphens: auto; }
  .reader-paper p:first-of-type::first-letter {
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 4em; float: left; line-height: 0.75;
    margin: 4px 8px 0 0; color: var(--accent);
  }

  /* ── READER: GOOGLE DRIVE IFRAME ── */
  .reader-drive-frame {
    width: 100%; height: 100%; border: none;
    background: #fff;
  }
  .reader-drive-msg {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    gap: 16px; padding: 48px 24px; text-align: center; flex: 1;
  }
  .reader-drive-msg svg { width: 56px; height: 56px; color: #4285f4; }
  .reader-drive-msg h3 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 22px; color: var(--reading-text); }
  .reader-drive-msg p { color: var(--reading-text2); font-size: 14px; max-width: 360px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .reader-drive-open {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
    background: #4285f4; color: #fff; border: none; border-radius: 50px;
    padding: 10px 22px; font-family: var(--font-ui); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500;
    cursor: pointer; transition: all var(--transition); text-decoration: none;
  }
  .reader-drive-open:hover { background: #3367d6; transform: translateY(-1px); }

  /* ── READER FOOTER ── */
  .reader-footer {
    position: sticky; bottom: 0; background: rgba(250,246,239,0.95); border-top: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
    padding: 10px 24px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    flex-shrink: 0; flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .reader-progress-track { flex: 1; height: 3px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.1); border-radius: 3px; position: relative; min-width: 60px; }
  .reader-progress-fill { height: 100%; background: var(--accent); border-radius: 3px; transition: width 0.3s; }
  .reader-page-info { font-size: 12px; color: var(--reading-text2); white-space: nowrap; font-family: var(--font-ui); }
  .font-size-ctrl { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
  .font-size-ctrl button { width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 50%; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.15); background: transparent; cursor: pointer; font-size: 14px; color: var(--reading-text2); transition: all var(--transition); }
  .font-size-ctrl button:hover { background: rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
  .font-size-ctrl span { font-size: 12px; color: var(--reading-text2); width: 32px; text-align: center; }

  /* ── MARK AS FINISHED BANNER ── */
  #finish-banner {
    display: none;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a3a25 0%, #1f4d30 100%);
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(90,158,111,0.4);
    padding: 14px 24px;
    flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  #finish-banner.visible { display: flex; }
  .finish-banner-top { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
  .finish-banner-icon { font-size: 24px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .finish-banner-text { flex: 1; }
  .finish-banner-title { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 15px; color: #a8d8b5; margin-bottom: 2px; }
  .finish-banner-sub { font-size: 12px; color: rgba(168,216,181,0.7); }
  .finish-banner-times { font-size: 12px; color: rgba(168,216,181,0.9); font-weight: 500; }
  .btn-finish {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; justify-content: center;
    background: var(--green); color: #fff; border: none; border-radius: 50px;
    padding: 10px 22px; font-family: var(--font-ui); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500;
    cursor: pointer; transition: all var(--transition); align-self: flex-start;
  }
  .btn-finish:hover { background: #4a8f5f; transform: translateY(-1px); box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(90,158,111,0.4); }
  .btn-finish:active { transform: translateY(0); }
  .btn-finish svg { width: 16px; height: 16px; }

  /* ── MODAL ── */
  #modal-overlay {
    display: none; position: fixed; inset: 0; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.7); z-index: 100;
    align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 16px; backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
  }
  #modal-overlay.open { display: flex; }
  .modal {
    background: var(--bg2); border: 1px solid var(--border2); border-radius: var(--r);
    width: 100%; max-width: 620px; max-height: 90vh; overflow-y: auto;
    box-shadow: 0 24px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.7);
    animation: modal-in 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.34,1.56,0.64,1);
  }
  @keyframes modal-in { from { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.95) translateY(20px); } }
  .modal-header { padding: 24px 24px 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
  .modal-title { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 20px; color: var(--accent); }
  .modal-body { padding: 20px 24px 24px; }
  .form-group { margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .form-label { display: block; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text3); margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .form-label-hint { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text3); text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; font-weight: 400; margin-left: 6px; }
  .form-input, .form-textarea, .form-select {
    width: 100%; padding: 10px 14px; background: var(--bg3); border: 1px solid var(--border2);
    border-radius: var(--r-sm); color: var(--text); font-family: var(--font-ui); font-size: 14px; outline: none;
    transition: border var(--transition);
  }
  .form-input:focus, .form-textarea:focus, .form-select:focus { border-color: var(--accent); }
  .form-textarea { resize: vertical; min-height: 160px; line-height: 1.6; font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 15px; }
  .form-select option { background: var(--bg2); }
  .form-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 14px; }
  .color-picker-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(8, 1fr); gap: 6px; }
  .color-swatch {
    aspect-ratio: 1; border-radius: 50%; cursor: pointer; border: 2px solid transparent;
    transition: transform var(--transition), border-color var(--transition);
  }
  .color-swatch:hover { transform: scale(1.15); }
  .color-swatch.selected { border-color: var(--accent); transform: scale(1.2); }
  .modal-footer { padding: 0 24px 24px; display: flex; gap: 10px; justify-content: flex-end; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .btn-cancel { padding: 9px 20px; border-radius: 50px; border: 1px solid var(--border2); background: transparent; color: var(--text2); font-family: var(--font-ui); font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer; transition: all var(--transition); }
  .btn-cancel:hover { background: var(--bg3); }
  .btn-submit { padding: 9px 24px; border-radius: 50px; border: none; background: var(--accent); color: var(--bg); font-family: var(--font-ui); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; cursor: pointer; transition: all var(--transition); }
  .btn-submit:hover { background: var(--accent2); }

  /* ── COVER PREVIEW IN MODAL ── */
  .cover-preview-wrap {
    display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: flex-start; margin-top: 10px;
  }
  .cover-preview-thumb {
    width: 60px; height: 90px; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--border2); flex-shrink: 0;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    background: var(--bg3); font-size: 22px;
  }
  .cover-preview-thumb img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
  .cover-preview-actions { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
  .btn-fetch-cover {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
    padding: 8px 14px; border-radius: var(--r-sm); border: 1px solid var(--border2);
    background: transparent; color: var(--text2); font-family: var(--font-ui); font-size: 12px; cursor: pointer;
    transition: all var(--transition); text-align: left;
  }
  .btn-fetch-cover:hover { background: var(--accent-dim); color: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); }
  .fetch-cover-status { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text3); padding: 4px 0; }

  /* ── CONTENT TYPE TABS ── */
  .content-type-tabs {
    display: flex; gap: 0; margin-bottom: 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border2); border-radius: var(--r-sm); overflow: hidden;
  }
  .content-tab {
    flex: 1; padding: 8px 12px; border: none; background: transparent;
    color: var(--text2); font-family: var(--font-ui); font-size: 12px; cursor: pointer;
    transition: all var(--transition); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 6px;
  }
  .content-tab:not(:last-child) { border-right: 1px solid var(--border2); }
  .content-tab.active { background: var(--accent-dim); color: var(--accent); font-weight: 500; }
  .content-tab svg { width: 13px; height: 13px; }

  /* ── DRIVE LINK INPUT ── */
  .drive-link-section { display: none; }
  .drive-link-section.active { display: block; }
  .drive-link-note {
    background: var(--bg3); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--r-sm);
    padding: 12px; margin-top: 10px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--text2); line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .drive-link-note strong { color: var(--accent); }

  /* ── SCROLLBAR ── */
  ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 6px; }
  ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: transparent; }
  ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: var(--border2); border-radius: 3px; }
  ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: var(--text3); }

  /* ── STATS BAR ── */
  .stats-bar { display: flex; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 28px; overflow-x: auto; padding-bottom: 4px; }
  .stat-card { flex: 1; min-width: 100px; background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--r); padding: 16px; }
  .stat-label { font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: var(--text3); margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .stat-value { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 28px; color: var(--accent); }
  .stat-sub { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text3); margin-top: 2px; }

  /* ── TOAST ── */
  #toast { position: fixed; bottom: 24px; right: 24px; background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border2); border-radius: var(--r); padding: 12px 20px; color: var(--text); font-size: 13px; z-index: 300; display: none; box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.4); max-width: calc(100vw - 32px); }
  #toast.show { display: block; animation: toast-in 0.3s ease; }
  @keyframes toast-in { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); } }

  /* ── DRIVE BACKUP ── */
  .drive-pill-wrap { position: relative; }
  .drive-pill {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; height: 36px; padding: 0 12px;
    border-radius: 50px; border: 1px solid var(--border2); background: transparent;
    color: var(--text2); font-family: var(--font-ui); font-size: 12px; cursor: pointer;
    transition: all var(--transition); white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .drive-pill:hover { background: var(--accent-dim); color: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); }
  .drive-pill svg { width: 14px; height: 14px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .drive-dot { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--text3); flex-shrink: 0; transition: background var(--transition); }
  .drive-pill[data-state="connecting"] .drive-dot { background: var(--accent); animation: drive-pulse 1s ease-in-out infinite; }
  .drive-pill[data-state="connected"] .drive-dot { background: var(--green); }
  .drive-pill[data-state="error"] .drive-dot { background: var(--red); }
  @keyframes drive-pulse { 0%,100% { opacity: 1; } 50% { opacity: 0.3; } }
  .drive-menu {
    position: absolute; top: calc(100% + 8px); right: 0; min-width: 220px;
    background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border2); border-radius: var(--r);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow); padding: 6px; z-index: 250; display: none; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px;
  }
  .drive-menu.open { display: flex; }
  .drive-menu-item {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 9px 10px; border-radius: var(--r-sm);
    border: none; background: transparent; color: var(--text2); font-family: var(--font-ui); font-size: 13px;
    cursor: pointer; text-align: left; transition: all var(--transition); width: 100%;
  }
  .drive-menu-item:hover { background: var(--accent-dim); color: var(--accent); }
  .drive-menu-item svg { width: 15px; height: 15px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .drive-menu-note { padding: 6px 10px 4px; font-size: 11px; color: var(--text3); border-top: 1px solid var(--border); margin-top: 4px; }
  .drive-reconnect-banner {
    grid-column: 1 / -1; display: none; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
    background: var(--accent-dim); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border2);
    color: var(--text); font-size: 13px; padding: 10px 24px; z-index: 15;
  }
  .drive-reconnect-banner.show { display: flex; }
  .drive-reconnect-banner .drive-reconnect-msg { flex: 1; }
  .drive-reconnect-banner button { font-family: var(--font-ui); font-size: 12px; cursor: pointer; border-radius: 50px; padding: 6px 14px; border: 1px solid var(--border2); background: transparent; color: var(--text2); }
  .drive-reconnect-banner button.drive-reconnect-act { background: var(--accent); color: var(--bg); border: none; }
  .drive-reconnect-banner button:hover { opacity: 0.85; }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .drive-pill .drive-pill-label { display: none; }
    .drive-pill { padding: 0 9px; }
  }

  /* ── MOBILE BOTTOM NAV ── */
  #mobile-nav {
    display: none;
    position: fixed; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    height: var(--mobile-nav-h);
    background: var(--bg2); border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    z-index: 30;
    padding-bottom: env(safe-area-inset-bottom);
  }
  .mobile-nav-inner { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-around; height: 64px; }
  .mobile-nav-btn {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    gap: 4px; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: var(--r-sm);
    border: none; background: transparent; color: var(--text3);
    font-family: var(--font-ui); font-size: 10px; cursor: pointer;
    transition: all var(--transition); min-width: 56px;
  }
  .mobile-nav-btn svg { width: 20px; height: 20px; }
  .mobile-nav-btn.active { color: var(--accent); }
  .mobile-nav-btn span { font-size: 10px; }

  /* ── SIDEBAR OVERLAY (mobile) ── */
  #sidebar-overlay {
    display: none; position: fixed; inset: 0; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
    z-index: 25; backdrop-filter: blur(2px);
  }
  #sidebar-overlay.open { display: block; animation: fade-in 0.2s ease; }
  @keyframes fade-in { from { opacity: 0; } }

  /* ── RESPONSIVE ── */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    :root { --topbar-h: 56px; }
    #app {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      grid-template-rows: var(--topbar-h) 1fr;
    }
    #topbar { padding: 0 12px; gap: 10px; }
    .menu-toggle { display: flex; }
    .topbar-search { margin-left: 0; }
    .logo { font-size: 18px; }
    .btn-primary .btn-label { display: none; }
    .btn-primary { padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 50%; width: 36px; height: 36px; justify-content: center; }
    .btn-primary svg { width: 16px; height: 16px; }

    #sidebar {
      position: fixed; left: 0; top: var(--topbar-h); bottom: 0;
      width: min(280px, 85vw);
      z-index: 26;
      transform: translateX(-100%);
      transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1);
      border-right: 1px solid var(--border2);
    }
    #sidebar.open { transform: translateX(0); }

    #main { padding-bottom: var(--mobile-nav-h); }
    #library-view { padding: 20px 16px; }
    .books-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(130px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; }
    .stats-bar { gap: 10px; }
    .stat-card { padding: 12px; }
    .stat-value { font-size: 22px; }
    .section-title { font-size: 20px; }
    .form-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }

    #reader-view { inset: var(--topbar-h) 0 0 0; }
    .reader-topbar { padding: 0 12px; gap: 8px; }
    .reader-controls { gap: 4px; }
    .reader-btn { padding: 5px 10px; font-size: 11px; }
    .font-size-ctrl button { width: 26px; height: 26px; }
    .reader-content { padding: 24px 16px 60px; }
    .reader-paper p { font-size: 16px; }
    .reader-chapter-title { font-size: 22px; }

    #mobile-nav { display: block; }
    #toast { bottom: calc(var(--mobile-nav-h) + 12px); right: 12px; left: 12px; text-align: center; }
    .finish-banner-top { flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .btn-finish { width: 100%; justify-content: center; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .books-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 12px; }
    .color-picker-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr); }
    #modal-overlay { padding: 0; align-items: flex-end; }
    .modal { border-radius: var(--r) var(--r) 0 0; max-height: 92vh; animation: sheet-in 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1); }
    @keyframes sheet-in { from { transform: translateY(100%); } }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="app">

  <!-- DRIVE RECONNECT BANNER -->
  <div class="drive-reconnect-banner" id="drive-reconnect-banner">
    <span class="drive-reconnect-msg">⚠️ No se pudo reconectar automáticamente con Google Drive. Tus libros siguen a salvo en este dispositivo.</span>
    <button class="drive-reconnect-act" onclick="driveConnect()">Reconectar</button>
    <button onclick="dismissReconnectBanner()">Descartar</button>
  </div>

  <!-- TOPBAR -->
  <header id="topbar">
    <button class="menu-toggle" onclick="toggleSidebar()" id="menu-toggle-btn" aria-label="Abrir menú">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="3" y1="6" x2="21" y2="6"/><line x1="3" y1="12" x2="21" y2="12"/><line x1="3" y1="18" x2="21" y2="18"/></svg>
    </button>
    <div class="logo">Biblio<span>teca</span></div>
    <div class="topbar-search">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><path d="m21 21-4.35-4.35"/></svg>
      <input type="text" placeholder="Buscar libros, autores..." id="search-input" oninput="filterBooks()">
    </div>
    <div class="topbar-actions">
      <div class="drive-pill-wrap">
        <button class="drive-pill" id="drive-pill" data-state="off" onclick="onDrivePillClick()" title="Google Drive backup">
          <span class="drive-dot" id="drive-dot"></span>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 2 2 19h20L12 2z" opacity="0"/><path d="M7.71 3.5 1.15 15l3.43 6L11.14 9.5z"/><path d="M16.29 3.5H7.71L1.15 15h8.58z" opacity="0"/><path d="M9.14 21h9.71l3.43-6h-9.71z"/><path d="M16.29 3.5 22.86 15h-3.43l-6.57-11.5z"/></svg>
          <span class="drive-pill-label" id="drive-pill-label">Drive</span>
        </button>
        <div class="drive-menu" id="drive-menu">
          <button class="drive-menu-item" id="drive-menu-connect" onclick="driveMenuAction('connect')">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"/><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"/></svg>
            Conectar Google Drive
          </button>
          <button class="drive-menu-item" id="drive-menu-backup" onclick="driveMenuAction('backup')" style="display:none;">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"/><line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"/></svg>
            Respaldar ahora
          </button>
          <button class="drive-menu-item" id="drive-menu-restore" onclick="driveMenuAction('restore')" style="display:none;">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 3-6.7"/><polyline points="3 4 3 8 7 8"/></svg>
            Restaurar desde Drive
          </button>
          <button class="drive-menu-item" id="drive-menu-disconnect" onclick="driveMenuAction('disconnect')" style="display:none;">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M18.36 6.64a9 9 0 1 1-12.73 0"/><line x1="12" y1="2" x2="12" y2="12"/></svg>
            Desconectar
          </button>
          <div class="drive-menu-note" id="drive-menu-status">Sin conectar — tus libros solo viven en este dispositivo.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <button class="btn-icon" onclick="toggleTheme()" title="Cambiar tema" id="theme-btn">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5"/><line x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="3"/><line x1="12" y1="21" x2="12" y2="23"/><line x1="4.22" y1="4.22" x2="5.64" y2="5.64"/><line x1="18.36" y1="18.36" x2="19.78" y2="19.78"/><line x1="1" y1="12" x2="3" y2="12"/><line x1="21" y1="12" x2="23" y2="12"/><line x1="4.22" y1="19.78" x2="5.64" y2="18.36"/><line x1="18.36" y1="5.64" x2="19.78" y2="4.22"/></svg>
      </button>
      <button class="btn-primary" onclick="openAddModal()">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" width="16" height="16"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg>
        <span class="btn-label">Agregar Libro</span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- SIDEBAR OVERLAY (mobile) -->
  <div id="sidebar-overlay" onclick="closeSidebar()"></div>

  <!-- SIDEBAR -->
  <nav id="sidebar">
    <div class="sidebar-section">
      <div class="sidebar-label">Biblioteca</div>
      <div class="nav-item active" onclick="setFilter('all',this);closeSidebar()" id="nav-all">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7"/><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7"/><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7"/></svg>
        Todos los libros
        <span class="nav-badge" id="count-all">0</span>
      </div>
      <div class="nav-item" onclick="setFilter('es',this);closeSidebar()" id="nav-es">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
        En Español
        <span class="nav-badge" id="count-es">0</span>
      </div>
      <div class="nav-item" onclick="setFilter('en',this);closeSidebar()" id="nav-en">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"/><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"/></svg>
        In English
        <span class="nav-badge" id="count-en">0</span>
      </div>
      <div class="nav-item" onclick="setFilter('reading',this);closeSidebar()" id="nav-reading">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2z"/><path d="M22 3h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v14a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7z"/></svg>
        Leyendo ahora
      </div>
      <div class="nav-item" onclick="setFilter('finished',this);closeSidebar()" id="nav-finished">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
        Terminados
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="sidebar-section">
      <div class="sidebar-label">Géneros</div>
    </div>
    <div class="sidebar-genres" id="genres-list"></div>

    <!-- IMPORT / EXPORT -->
    <div class="sidebar-data-section">
      <div class="sidebar-label" style="padding:0 0 4px;">Mis datos</div>
      <button class="btn-data" onclick="exportLibrary()">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"/><line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"/></svg>
        Exportar biblioteca (.json)
      </button>
      <button class="btn-data" onclick="triggerImport()">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><polyline points="17 8 12 3 7 8"/><line x1="12" y1="3" x2="12" y2="15"/></svg>
        Importar biblioteca (.json)
      </button>
      <input type="file" id="import-file-input" accept=".json" style="display:none" onchange="importLibrary(event)">
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- MAIN CONTENT -->
  <main id="main">
    <div id="library-view">
      <div class="stats-bar" id="stats-bar"></div>
      <div class="section-header">
        <div>
          <div class="section-title" id="section-title">Mi Biblioteca</div>
          <div class="section-sub" id="section-sub">Tu colección personal de libros e historias</div>
        </div>
        <div id="view-toggle" style="display:flex;gap:6px;">
          <button class="btn-sm" style="flex:0;padding:6px 12px;" onclick="setViewMode('grid')" id="view-grid">⊞</button>
          <button class="btn-sm" style="flex:0;padding:6px 12px;" onclick="setViewMode('list')" id="view-list">☰</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="books-grid" id="books-grid"></div>
    </div>
  </main>
</div>

<!-- READER VIEW -->
<div id="reader-view">
  <div class="reader-topbar">
    <button class="reader-btn" onclick="closeReader()">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" width="14" height="14" style="display:inline;vertical-align:-2px;margin-right:4px"><line x1="19" y1="12" x2="5" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 19 5 12 12 5"/></svg>
      Biblioteca
    </button>
    <div class="reader-title" id="reader-title"></div>
    <div class="reader-controls">
      <div class="font-size-ctrl" id="font-size-ctrl">
        <button onclick="changeFontSize(-1)">A−</button>
        <span id="font-size-display">18</span>
        <button onclick="changeFontSize(1)">A+</button>
      </div>
      <button class="reader-btn" onclick="toggleReaderTheme()" id="reader-theme-btn">☽ Noche</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <!-- Text content -->
  <div class="reader-content" id="reader-content" onscroll="updateReadingProgress()">
    <div class="reader-paper" id="reader-paper"></div>
  </div>
  <!-- Google Drive content -->
  <div id="reader-drive-area" style="display:none;flex:1;flex-direction:column;">
    <div class="reader-drive-msg" id="reader-drive-msg">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 87.3 78" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6.6 66.85 3.85 6.65c.8 1.4 1.95 2.5 3.3 3.3l13.75-23.8h-27.5c0 1.55.4 3.1 1.2 4.5z" fill="#0066da"/><path d="m43.65 25-13.75-23.8c-1.35.8-2.5 1.9-3.3 3.3l-25.4 44a9.06 9.06 0 0 0 -1.2 4.5h27.5z" fill="#00ac47"/><path d="m73.55 76.8c1.35-.8 2.5-1.9 3.3-3.3l1.6-2.75 7.65-13.25c.8-1.4 1.2-2.95 1.2-4.5h-27.502l5.852 11.5z" fill="#ea4335"/><path d="m43.65 25 13.75-23.8c-1.35-.8-2.9-1.2-4.5-1.2h-18.5c-1.6 0-3.15.45-4.5 1.2z" fill="#00832d"/><path d="m59.8 53h-32.3l-13.75 23.8c1.35.8 2.9 1.2 4.5 1.2h50.8c1.6 0 3.15-.45 4.5-1.2z" fill="#2684fc"/><path d="m73.4 26.5-12.7-22c-.8-1.4-1.95-2.5-3.3-3.3l-13.75 23.8 16.15 28h27.45c0-1.55-.4-3.1-1.2-4.5z" fill="#ffba00"/></svg>
      <h3 id="drive-book-title">Libro en Google Drive</h3>
      <p id="drive-book-desc">Este libro está vinculado a Google Drive. Haz clic para abrirlo en una nueva pestaña, o visualízalo abajo si el archivo lo permite.</p>
      <a id="drive-open-link" class="reader-drive-open" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" width="16" height="16"><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"/><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"/><line x1="10" y1="14" x2="21" y2="3"/></svg>
        Abrir en Google Drive
      </a>
    </div>
    <iframe id="reader-drive-frame" class="reader-drive-frame" style="display:none;" allowfullscreen></iframe>
  </div>

  <!-- Footer (shown for text books) -->
  <div class="reader-footer" id="reader-footer">
